9 Performance characteristics
Because of the varying nature of the solid biofuels covered by this document, it is not possible to give a
precision statement (repeatability or reproducibility) for this test method.
10 Test report
The test report shall include at least the following information:
a) an identification of the laboratory performing the test and the date of the test;
b) an identification of the product (or sample) tested;
c)
a reference to this document, i.e. ISO 18134-2;
d) the results of the test on wet basis;
e) any unusual features noted during the determination which might affect the result;
f)
any deviation from this document or operations regarded as optional.

